Package: remoteoutcome
Title: Program Evaluation with Remotely Sensed Outcomes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ashesh", "Rambachan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "ashesh@mit.edu"),
    person("Rahul", "Singh", role = "aut"),
    person("Davide", "Viviano", role = "aut")
  )
Description: Implements the RSV (Remotely Sensed Variable) estimator for
    treatment effects when outcomes are imperfectly measured by remotely
    sensed variables such as satellite imagery or mobile phone activity.
    Supports binary and multi-category outcomes, discrete covariates,
    cross-fitting, and influence-function and score-bootstrap standard errors.
    Based on Rambachan, Singh, and Viviano (2024) <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2411.10959>.
